tasks.prompt:
Make this package script portable across Windows PowerShell and Linux bash. Explain the platform difference, provide a portable alternative, and include a verification step.

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "test:ci": "NODE_ENV=test bun test"
  }
}
```

The command works on Linux but fails in Windows PowerShell because the environment variable assignment syntax is different.

Make this cleanup command portable across Windows and Linux. Explain the platform difference, provide a portable alternative, and include a verification step.

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "clean": "rm -rf dist coverage"
  }
}
```

The command works on Linux and macOS but fails for contributors using Windows without a Unix shell.

Make this cleanup script portable across Windows PowerShell and Linux bash. Explain the platform difference, provide a Node/Bun-based portable alternative, and include a verification step.

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "clean": "rm -rf dist coverage && mkdir -p dist/tmp && cp config/default.json dist/tmp/default.json"
  }
}
```

The command relies on Unix shell builtins and path behavior. Windows contributors without a Unix shell report that cleanup fails before tests start.
